IMPORT prelude
IMPORT policy

-- Per-claim data for the nine benchmark questions. Standing preamble applied
-- to every question (per fixtures/queries-blind.md): "Assuming all other
-- conditions are met and no other exclusions apply (where by 'other,' I mean
-- anything not referenced in the query that follows)", and the agreement is
-- signed with the premium paid on time. So every field not mentioned by a
-- given question is set to a value that keeps it out of the way: no fraud,
-- no misrepresentation, no withheld information, no excluded activity, an
-- age well under 80, an early hospitalization date well inside the one-year
-- term, and NOTHING (not yet due/known) for the wellness-visit fields.
--
-- Judgement call (see NOTES.md for the full discussion): a question that
-- says only "confirmation/proof of my wellness visit was provided/submitted
-- N months after the effective date" is read as fixing the SUBMISSION time
-- (Section 1.3's 7-month deadline) only. The underlying visit's own
-- occurrence date is a distinct fact that none of the nine questions states,
-- so it is left as NOTHING (not known to be late) rather than assumed equal
-- to the submission date.

§ `Q1 -- burns suffered while on firefighting duty`

q1 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `age at hospitalization`                                            IS 40
    `hospitalization months after effective date`                       IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation submitted months after effective date` IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred months after effective date`               IS NOTHING
    `fraud committed`                                                   IS FALSE
    `misrepresentation committed`                                       IS FALSE
    `material information withheld`                                     IS FALSE
    `caused by skydiving`                                               IS FALSE
    `caused by military service`                                        IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                                    IS TRUE
    `caused by police service`                                          IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q1

