§ `Q9 -- son bit claimant's ankle, wellness proof provided 6 months after effective date, serving as police at the time`

-- The stated cause of the hospitalization is the son's bite, not the
-- claimant's police service; merely being on duty at the time an unrelated
-- domestic injury occurs does not mean the injury "arises directly or
-- indirectly out of" police service (Section 2.1). So `caused by police
-- service` is FALSE here -- see NOTES.md.

q9 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `age at hospitalization`                                            IS 40
    `hospitalization months after effective date`                       IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation submitted months after effective date` IS JUST 6
    `wellness visit occurred months after effective date`               IS NOTHING
    `fraud committed`                                                   IS FALSE
    `misrepresentation committed`                                       IS FALSE
    `material information withheld`                                     IS FALSE
    `caused by skydiving`                                               IS FALSE
    `caused by military service`                                        IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                                    IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                                          IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q9
